&lt;p&gt;Banners, logos, and thumbnails are downloaded and configured prior to the track being announced.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Setting these values too high will result in missing artwork the first time an artist is picked. See the documentation for more details.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
